  "idea": "Slack vs Discord: which platform is best for internal team communication",
  "text": "Slack vs Discord: which one keeps your team focused instead of distracted? Unstructured messaging and endless notifications destroy deep work across fast-moving remote companies. Discord's informal layout invites constant social distractions, while Slack's red badges create perpetual context-switching anxiety. Enforce structured Slack threads for documentation, then restrict Discord audio to scheduled thirty-minute co-working sprints. This disciplined system reclaims ten hours of weekly focus.",
